    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-115905",
      "kind": "accepted-risk-upstream-package",
      "reason": "Accepted by the owner on 2026-11-05 for the AlmaLinux 10 base 5ef1b06e. Red Hat rates the CVE Critical (CVSS 3.1 8.1, draft), records RHEL 10 firefox as Affected and publishes no fixed build: the flaw is in the zip streaming extractor, the package is the vendor's, and DeskOS neither builds nor patches it. Blocking the fleet would not reduce the risk; the fix is the distribution's rebuild in a later base. The tracked issue is #420, and the base bump that carries it closes the entry. This record makes the acceptance explicit and expires on the review date below.",
